{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Neon Dash</i></strong> is a Retro-Futurism style rhythm platformer game. Get past challenging obstacles to the music's beat, and journey back to the dreamy 80s to push your limits!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump, fly, switch gravity, and teleport to the beat of the music to avoid various obstacles on the platforms. By collecting BEATs, you can unlock different idle backgrounds and attempt to gather all STARs to achieve the perfect completion!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3768570/extras/9fd70d337ea4f7162d1e472442943ef5.avif?t=1768670123\" width=960 height=400 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rhythm-based platformer game</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenging level design</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Retro 80s-style music</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sunset, neon lights, palm trees, and more!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interactive items like flying, teleportation, and more!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect items to achieve perfect completion</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Idle-Friendly Animated Wallpaper</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock different idle backgrounds</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3768570?t=1768670123","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3768570/c44186540172e6172212b0cceb0e7b6625b3b0e1/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1768670123","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3768570/9ff71c9538a98d29c7671d764a49f892014eedd3/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768670123","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/37685